     
@RFQDetailsModule
Feature: RFQ item management

  Scenario: Add item from Excel sheet and send to Vendor successfully
    Given User is on the RFQ details page
    When User clicks on "Add Row" button
    And User enters item details from Excel sheet "src/resources/testdata/RFQ_Items.xlsx"
    And User clicks on "Send Email" button      ← triggers version popup
    And User creates a new version              ← clicks "Create Version"  
    And User adds a note "Please review..."     ← fills textarea + Save
    And User selects vendors "Test_1,Test_2"    ← opens vendor popup, checks boxes + Save
    And User sends the email                    ← clicks final "Send Email" in compose
    Then item should be added and email sent to vendor successfully
         